# The checker crate embeds these SVGs in Rust documentation at compile time.
!robosapiens-trustworthiness-checker/docs/
!robosapiens-trustworthiness-checker/docs/src/
!robosapiens-trustworthiness-checker/docs/src/assets/
!robosapiens-trustworthiness-checker/docs/src/assets/dataflow/
!robosapiens-trustworthiness-checker/docs/src/assets/dataflow/*.svg

# Top-level documentation is not needed at runtime; it remains in the source tree.
README.md
LICENSE.md
ICA-USAGE-MODE.txt
